**[Slide 4 — Zurich CH Commercial SME: Property & Liability]**

> "Let me ground this in a real program. // This is Zurich CH Commercial SME — a Property and Commercial Liability customization on Guidewire PolicyCenter. // Six user stories, forty-one acceptance criteria, sixty-nine test cases, and full requirement coverage — six out of six. // Everything you're about to see traces back to this one specification."


